// ENDING/BOOK CONTRACT v0.2
Template book may contain:
- identity summary: runName, age, highestRealm, mainPath/title if real;
- 3..10 actual major facts;
- importantPeople: 0..3 actual NPCs only;
- keyCauses: 1..4 actual echoed/decisive Causes when available;
- unresolved: 0..3 actual visible unresolved Causes;
- metaUnlocks actually granted;
- primary CTA: rebirth.
First-life product target: at least 1 clearly traceable "earlier choice -> later echo" when the run produced such a Cause.
Never fabricate a third NPC, extra Cause, regret, mystery or unlock to satisfy layout.
Run world resets on rebirth (D008); "后篇" means unlocked content in a new Run, not same NPC instance memory.
